{"summary":"A zen puzzle game with a beautifully immersive atmosphere to sharpen your mind.","description":"Oculux is a relaxing, minimalist and beautiful puzzle game that offers hundreds of hand-crafted levels to immerse yourself into. A dreamy meditative soundtrack accompanies you in your delightful experience.\n\n<b>How to play</b>\n\nMove the orb by swiping your finger in the direction you would like to move. Avoid traps and use different puzzle mechanics to collect all the diamonds in the least amount of moves possible.\n\n<b>Features</b>\n\n★ 200 hand-crafted puzzles\n★ Clean and minimalist design\n★ Undos and solutions available to help solve puzzles\n★ Supports cloud saving and device synchronization\n★ Optimized for both phones and tablets\n\nDon't hesitate to contact us if you find any issue with the game or if you simply want to send us your feedback, it is greatly appreciated!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$1.49 - $3.49 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_BWESLnPg-o?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FXo6E4HP9FQjGnlXX_sbEyC8OCHi0mvhzU4Gok6pdNE1QPweWzEWXPKLeJfm3N32nAWr7hnXEQ3HuSG4oF3lGg","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TT8lRzyasfRwHzH4Ood3UlVmerq-IxRCugRxsMDt4kcvTkkL3A8MKNkfFcfbut4F7FgcMZIDYbf4XC62AwfBAtg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5hAxMl9GhHUfFkQBnMOYgOIbHdNhT4GDN6mAfIgZXzFOFyZGOpNzwAocDrGTPiYY1gx6PXP0-s353lV1T90t","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/V-qS7lcIp8vG99XDi-rx6qCRQT2aMLwp2j_DP20oH0zH8BiXYtq55A8EupDgEwZZgbk3peXMdxxv3mZknHwczA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yX5oNY6Um_TFOqnqFLGd48Yg-vD6XZkkXmwgBF301Yxz8aM23KwKjm89acuAXvG7YrbFi-wN4JF_lU9ByAS7","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TR-G9qF7K5ZRw6TXV_qy3FXWVN99RfXzMGHprEmSbfaapBuCRviuQzCdmypIDbhaQzh1Yr9z6ej2HfIRiHopGtU","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9BwsCLYVy-2o_rDfQUF5AOAUADodCZyJwVvkCM_2KZU5smddqCUUHWzW5vPwYljp5FJGA8165o5QE5cL3Hwq6Q","https://play-lh.googleuse